    "canonical_ref": "PL80.FU.1.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "divino admonitus instinctu, per suum alumnum Dei servum Augustinum explere curavit. Gregorius igitur, quinto ordinationis suae anno,",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      597,
      604
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu#PL80.FU.1.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.FU.1.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "videlicet sub anno Domini 597 misit beatum Augustinum et alios cum eo quamplures monachos ac verbi Dei ministros quasi numero quadraginta genti Anglorum fidem prae- dicare catholicam,",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      597,
      604
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu#PL80.FU.1.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.FU.1.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "qui Dei ministri qualiter se gere- bant in itinere versus Angliam qualiterque Angliam venientes in Thaneto applicuerunt;",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      597,
      604
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu#PL80.FU.1.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.FU.1.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "qualiterve a rege Athelberto suscepti fuerant qualiterque Cantuariam pervenerant, pertractare omitto; cum haec omnia in textu Vitae Augustini pertractentur.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      597,
      604
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu#PL80.FU.1.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.FU.1.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Augustinus igi- tur cum suis sociis, locum in civitate Cantuariae adeptus, vitam coepit imitari apostolicam.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      597,
      604
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu#PL80.FU.1.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.FU.1.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Interea rex Athelbertus servorum Dei vita mundissima delectatus, et promissis eorum suavissimis quae miraculorum ostensione vera esse perspexerat,",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      597,
      604
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu#PL80.FU.1.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.FU.1.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "in fide roboratus catholica cum suis commilitonibus baptizatus est in die Pentecostes sub anno Domini 597.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      597,
      604
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu#PL80.FU.1.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.FU.1.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Rege itaque baptizato et in fide confirmato Augustinus ad civita- tem Galliarum Arelatensem progreditur et ab ejusdem urbis episcopo Etherio in episcopum ordinatur, sub die XVI Kalendas Decembris,",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      597,
      604
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu#PL80.FU.1.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.FU.1.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ordinatusque Augustinus Angliam rediit, et cum gloria et omni qua decuit so- lemnitate a rege et populo susceptus, atque in civitate Cantuariae sedem episcopalem adeptus,",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      597,
      604
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu#PL80.FU.1.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/augustinus-cantuariensis/pl80_14_fu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.FU.1.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "continuo Laurentium presbyterum, et Petrum monachum Ro- mam misit, qui beato pontifici Gregorio referrent regem cum regno fidem Christi suscepisse,",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 600,
    "date_range": [
      597,
      604
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
